    "detailed_description": "Explore the boundless world of SPACE MINING COMPANY and revolutionize ore mining in space. The endless expanses of the cosmos are waiting to be explored and profitably exploited by you. Take the plunge into an exciting future and fulfill your dreams as a visionary space entrepreneur. Grab your ticket to space and get started today! The stars are calling for you - become part of a captivating saga full of success stories.<br><br><strong>START YOUR MINING COMPANY</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/643eb9a5bc533add15ebd3c7e8e218f6.poster.avif?t=1694162643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/643eb9a5bc533add15ebd3c7e8e218f6.webm?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/643eb9a5bc533add15ebd3c7e8e218f6.mp4?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Discover the fascinating beauty of space and become an astrodia explorer. Explore unexplored territories, mine valuable ore and make your dreams come true. Travel through galaxies and prepare for the adventure of a lifetime to discover the untold treasures of the universe. The time has come for you to explore the universe and shape your future as a daring space explorer!<br><br><strong><br>EXPLORE THE SPACE</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/5ee32a460e8f8757a9c4149d5640dcb9.poster.avif?t=1694162643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/5ee32a460e8f8757a9c4149d5640dcb9.webm?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/5ee32a460e8f8757a9c4149d5640dcb9.mp4?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In the world of progress, constantly rise to conquer success! Standstill means downfall. No inertia, no resting on past laurels.<br>Excellence is achieved through continuous improvement of tools and skills. Optimize resources and expand your performance limits to extract more ore.<br>Don't stay in the status quo! Evolve, explore new avenues and unleash your full potential. Master your craft and open the door to limitless possibilities and success!<br><br><br><strong>SKILL YOUR TOOLS</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/8651d42283db909925d05c81433b0a21.poster.avif?t=1694162643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/8651d42283db909925d05c81433b0a21.webm?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/8651d42283db909925d05c81433b0a21.mp4?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Explore the boundless world of SPACE MINING COMPANY and revolutionize ore mining in space. The endless expanses of the cosmos are waiting to be explored and profitably exploited by you. Take the plunge into an exciting future and fulfill your dreams as a visionary space entrepreneur. Grab your ticket to space and get started today! The stars are calling for you - become part of a captivating saga full of success stories.<br><br><strong>START YOUR MINING COMPANY</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/643eb9a5bc533add15ebd3c7e8e218f6.poster.avif?t=1694162643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/643eb9a5bc533add15ebd3c7e8e218f6.webm?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/643eb9a5bc533add15ebd3c7e8e218f6.mp4?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Discover the fascinating beauty of space and become an astrodia explorer. Explore unexplored territories, mine valuable ore and make your dreams come true. Travel through galaxies and prepare for the adventure of a lifetime to discover the untold treasures of the universe. The time has come for you to explore the universe and shape your future as a daring space explorer!<br><br><strong><br>EXPLORE THE SPACE</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/5ee32a460e8f8757a9c4149d5640dcb9.poster.avif?t=1694162643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/5ee32a460e8f8757a9c4149d5640dcb9.webm?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/5ee32a460e8f8757a9c4149d5640dcb9.mp4?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In the world of progress, constantly rise to conquer success! Standstill means downfall. No inertia, no resting on past laurels.<br>Excellence is achieved through continuous improvement of tools and skills. Optimize resources and expand your performance limits to extract more ore.<br>Don't stay in the status quo! Evolve, explore new avenues and unleash your full potential. Master your craft and open the door to limitless possibilities and success!<br><br><br><strong>SKILL YOUR TOOLS</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/8651d42283db909925d05c81433b0a21.poster.avif?t=1694162643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/8651d42283db909925d05c81433b0a21.webm?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435370/extras/8651d42283db909925d05c81433b0a21.mp4?t=1694162643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
